{"entity": "Nano-Enhanced PCMs", "type": "concept", "description": "Nano-Enhanced PCMs are phase change materials (PCMs) that have been improved through the incorporation of nanoparticle additives, representing a material-level PCM innovation designed to enhance composite performance, particularly thermal conductivity and heat transfer capability.

