{"entity1": "Nano-Enhanced Phase Change Materials", "entity2": "Phase Change Materials", "description": "Nano-Enhanced Phase Change Materials (NePCMs) represent an advanced, enhanced category and a direct variant of traditional Phase Change Materials (PCMs). Standard Phase Change Material technology serves as the essential foundational basis for the development of these modern iterations. \n\nThese specialized materials are created by integrating, adding, or improving base Phase Change Materials with various nanomaterials and nanoparticles. The incorporation of these nanomaterial additives fundamentally transforms the traditional materials into a highly modified composite state. \n\nThe primary objective of utilizing these nanoparticles is to significantly boost the overall performance of the base materials. Specifically, this nano-enhancement is designed to yield improved thermal properties and superior thermal performance compared to conventional Phase Change Materials.<SEP>Nano-enhanced phase change materials are phase change materials enhanced with nanoparticles."}
