Application of Inorganic – Organic Eutectic PCM (Phase Change Material) To Improve Coolbox Efficiency

Nanda Yuniarti<sup>1</sup>, Mifta Fatimah Supandi<sup>1</sup>, Caecilia Pudjiastuti<sup>1</sup>, Ketut Sumada<sup>1</sup>, Stefano Ladini<sup>2</sup>, Erwan Adi Saputro<sup>1</sup>\*

