{"entity1": "Metakaolin", "entity2": "Multi-PCM Lime Mortars", "description": "The relation (Metakaolin, Multi-PCM Lime Mortars) describes the incorporation of metakaolin into multi-PCM lime mortars as a functional additive that modifies and improves the material's properties. Metakaolin is included in these mortars as an addition rather than a replacement constituent, and the mortars are formulated with varying metakaolin contents. Additionally, multi-PCM lime mortar formulations are prepared both with and without metakaolin, and this comparative design, along with metakaolin's densification effects, serves to reinforce conclusions about the robustness of the formulation strategy.

